                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/609.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-01T15:00:00-04:49"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi>
                            1, 1911—3 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The President has requested permission to embark on an American war vessel
                    pending the arrival of the merchant vessel on Friday. The minister asks
                    instructions.</p>
